# Compiled output. Built by the Dockerfile, build.sh, or `go build`.
#
# The trailing negations matter: a bare "/server" also matches the server/
# source directory, which silently keeps the entire backend out of the
# repository. Ignore the binaries, then put the directories back.
/server
!/server/
/manage
!/manage/
/rook
dist/